penGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/HUARGQHB7ovbPkUaYUmsqGBCLG4uHpCEr3q8zGcupump?timestamp=1792149000000","description":"","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.19267"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/Narra_Creator/status/2111019291612958804"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/bsc/0x04f750a7ae4afdbe79148731b4a69bac3b0a1b22","chainId":"bsc","tokenAddress":"0x04f750A7ae4aFDbE79148731B4a69bAC3B0a1b22","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/mI0heeFaU3aNJnYz?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/bsc/0x04f750a7ae4afdbe79148731b4a69bac3b0a1b22?timestamp=1792149000000","description":"Six Seven AI ($67AI) is a memecoin launched on 14 October 2026 on the BNB Smart Chain (BEP-20). The token is deployed using the LayerZero OFT (Omnichain Fungible Token) standard and currently operates on BNB Chain. Its total supply is fixed at 100,000,000 tokens, and the contract contains no function to create additional tokens.\n\nThe project combines an automatic supply-reduction mechanism with an on-chain tool for generating AI media. Each buy or sell transaction carries a 9% fee: 1% is burned (sent to a dead address, permanently reducing supply) and 8% is allocated to marketing, token buybacks and the staking reward pool. Transfers between wallets that are not trades are not taxed.\n\nThrough the project website, holders connect a wallet and spend $67AI to generate AI images and videos. Generating an image burns 500 $67AI; video generation burns 2,000, 4,000 or 6,000 $67AI depending on the option selected. Each creation is a transfer to the burn address, so use of the tool reduces the supply. Image generation is processed in the browser, while video generation is processed through a server-side AI service.\n\nHolders can stake their tokens to earn rewards paid in BNB. Staking supports lock periods of 14, 28 or 42 days, with longer locks and larger amounts increasing a staker's share of the reward pool. The staking system defines three tiers (Bronze, Silver and Gold) that apply reward multipliers and grant free AI creations within daily limits. The reward pool is funded in BNB by the project team.\n\nThe initial supply was allocated in two parts. 40,000,000 tokens (40%) were paired with BNB to provide liquidity on PancakeSwap, and the resulting liquidity-provider (LP) tokens were sent to the dead address, locking the liquidity permanently. The remaining 60,000,000 tokens (60%) are held in a separate contract referred to as the Burn Vault. This contract can send its balance to the burn address but has no function to withdraw, transfer or sell the tokens, so the reserve can only be burned.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://sixsevenai.netlify.app/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/Sixseven_AI"},{"type":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/sixsevenaii"}],"cto":false}]